: "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21843, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014AxwvetX6JM9mVc2tqud6c", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21843, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011nbwenPkdWJp6YyUzQbhXT", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 22143, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011nbwenPkdWJp6YyUzQbhXT", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 22143, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011nbwenPkdWJp6YyUzQbhXT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 26899, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TYshmX4TY53K63Zjw28RVk", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Release history shows v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 both unhealthy; the most recent healthy release is v2.3.0. Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error; halted after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed). A retry finished the rollout in us-west and eu-west. Current state: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up needed: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression and the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57499, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TYshmX4TY53K63Zjw28RVk", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57499, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TYshmX4TY53K63Zjw28RVk", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 60126, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GRQpYpEEyDmE8FhHEPkBob", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 60426, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GRQpYpEEyDmE8FhHEPkBob", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 60426, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GRQpYpEEyDmE8FhHEPkBob", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 65417, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version choice:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that passed health checks. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, both failed.\n- **First attempt:** this only partly worked. It updated us-east, then stopped with an orchestrator error, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1.\n- **Retry:** I ran it again, since rolling back to the same version twice is harmless. It finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are on v2.3.0 and passing health checks. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open. It describes the failure, the rollback including the partial failure and retry, the current state, and two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 broke, and why the orchestrator errored during the rollback.\n- The request to create the incident timed out, but when I checked, it had been created. I didn't send it again, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CtZafhr66GwMbrM9pbDjrb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TtpjjtQ5TJmJha9ipNPoGm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). Everything after it, v2.3.1-rc (seq 2) and v2.3.1 (seq 3), is unhealthy. I'm rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Q16Ajs72gEemGzedW58ggL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JSYpJVtHL2qeSUyDTLdGE3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only reached us-east. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once to finish the other regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SSVAHfSqMLYM8Jjrp7xnun", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014AxwvetX6JM9mVc2tqud6c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011nbwenPkdWJp6YyUzQbhXT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01TYshmX4TY53K63Zjw28RVk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Release history shows v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 both unhealthy; the most recent healthy release is v2.3.0. Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error; halted after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed). A retry finished the rollout in us-west and eu-west. Current state: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up needed: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression and the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I'll check whether the incident was created before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01GRQpYpEEyDmE8FhHEPkBob", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version choice:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that passed health checks. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, both failed.\n- **First attempt:** this only partly worked. It updated us-east, then stopped with an orchestrator error, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1.\n- **Retry:** I ran it again, since rolling back to the same version twice is harmless. It finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are on v2.3.0 and passing health checks. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open. It describes the failure, the rollback including the partial failure and retry, the current state, and two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 broke, and why the orchestrator errored during the rollback.\n- The request to create the incident timed out, but when I checked, it had been created. I didn't send it again, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.", "type": "text"}]}]}